{"title":"這段時間在各區間的時數","description":"選定期間在各區間的移動時間（h:mm）與佔比。\n怎麼看：每根長條一個區間，區間越高顏色越深（心率紅色系、功率橘色系）；上方三段條 = 3 區摘要（心率 < AeT／AeT–LTHR／≥ LTHR；功率 < 80%／80–95%／≥ 95% CP）。期間、區間模型、運動可以換，選擇會記住。\n看什麼：低強度至少 75%，基礎期 ≥ 90%；減量期高強度要保留。\n方法：每次活動用當天有效的門檻切區間（圖下方列出）；只算移動時間（> 1.6 km/h，同 WKO5），手錶推估的功率不算。Seiler 2006、Seiler & Tønnessen 2009、Uphill Athlete、Bosquet 2007；高強度 < 1% 算「沒有」是推估。","kind":"periodzones","zone_kind":"hr","model":{"id":"frielhr","title":"Friel 7 區（% LTHR）","source":"Friel 心率區間（WKO5 的 Friel HR 表，% LTHR）","estimate":false},"models":{"hr":[{"id":"frielhr","title":"Friel 7 區（% LTHR）","estimate":false},{"id":"classichr","title":"WKO5 Classic 5 區（% LTHR）","estimate":false},{"id":"seiler3","title":"Seiler 3 區（AeT／LTHR）","estimate":false}],"power":[{"id":"palladino","title":"Palladino 10 區（% CP）","estimate":false},{"id":"palladino3","title":"3 區（Palladino 80／95% CP）","estimate":false}]},"default_model":{"hr":"frielhr","power":"palladino"},"sports":["trail","hike"],"sport_choices":[{"id":"road","label":"路跑"},{"id":"trail","label":"越野跑"},{"id":"hike","label":"登山健行"}],"summary_model":{"id":"seiler3","title":"Seiler 3 區（AeT／LTHR）"},"view":"total","period":{"key":"lastweek","label":"上週","begin":"2026-09-21","end":"2026-09-27","days":7,"note":null,"phase":{"kind":"specific","label":"專項期","start":"2026-09-05","end":"2026-10-16"}},"period_choices":[{"id":"range","label":"日期範圍"},{"id":"week","label":"本週"},{"id":"lastweek","label":"上週"},{"id":"4w","label":"近 4 週"},{"id":"phase","label":"本期"},{"id":"custom","label":"自訂"}],"rows":[{"id":"1","name":"Recovery","pct":"< 85% LTHR","range":"< 143 bpm","seconds":5245.0,"share":0.39060172773309504},{"id":"2","name":"Aerobic","pct":"85–90% LTHR","range":"143–151 bpm","seconds":7381.0,"share":0.549672326481978},{"id":"3","name":"Tempo","pct":"90–95% LTHR","range":"151–160 bpm","seconds":802.0,"share":0.059725945784927015},{"id":"4","name":"SubThreshold","pct":"95–100% LTHR","range":"160–168 bpm","seconds":0.0,"share":0.0},{"id":"5a","name":"SuperTh